{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "701927a33ab5aeba77b6b3e72d99c219715a7bcf4c45460b045ea5bc44be4557", "ja": "キャンペーンガールのお仕事", "zh": "Show Girl的工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4000_place", "source_sha256": "f99c7333b0d5702c3ba984dfc3b046dfc06dc55f318e406c717b0ca3d60d4dcf", "ja": "ゲームショウ控え室", "zh": "电玩展准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4001_047sub", "source_sha256": "96a1ab45984891ef7d2811f36f7a5a42c3e0f4d0f58cb552fb0f673b39f63279", "ja": "{$P$}！\nなんだよ、あの衣装～！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n那套服装怎么回事啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4002_p", "source_sha256": "6a0355f5aa31d13e0fe19d0d125445e0ae1ec0d4dc2a7fbfd20f159afe46bccf", "ja": "どうした、昴？\n何か手違いでもあったのか？", "zh": "怎么了，昴？\n出了什么差错吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4003_047sub", "source_sha256": "dcc460d951c8aa57ec0b9d13baeab7b55c3f4cff5b4277288db23deed57ba468", "ja": "あ、あんな、すっげーフリフリの\nカワイイ衣装着るなんて、聞いてなかったし……。", "zh": "我、我可没听说要穿上那种\n充满荷叶边的可爱服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4004_047sub", "source_sha256": "a8d06041db3109eecb9b98b18b4c55c975171933af981e8ce9893b2a41f51c6a", "ja": "あんなのオレ、絶対似合わないって！\nどんな顔して着ればいいんだよ～！", "zh": "那绝对不适合我啦！\n我该用什么表情穿它才对啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4005_047sub", "source_sha256": "cd848933eb2898195bc48ac9c10f947ca524d293f1d63aaf47c34ba31bf9abdd", "ja": "せっかくの仕事なのに、みんなに笑われたら失敗だろ？\nどうしよう、{$P$}……！？", "zh": "难得有这个工作机会，要是让大家笑话不就搞砸了吗？\n怎么办啊，{$P$}……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4006_p", "source_sha256": "59fdbae1b1383d778a4a1691f3883589261dded69e0f4f788f4827b23a95d99a", "ja": "落ち着こう、昴。大丈夫だって。", "zh": "冷静点，昴，没问题的，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4007", "source_sha256": "c56f4578c25aed16c3ca65762a9ef241d829f9b61411cb08e5090d081f40cdc5", "ja": "いつも通りにしよう", "zh": "和平常一样", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4008", "source_sha256": "befe173814fb3f306a0d13ed34a3be5fed3dbee3825f883744e2b9d0c0799e61", "ja": "アイドルっぽく！", "zh": "像偶像一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4009", "source_sha256": "f72adcd5ba8ac9dbf3ee904979b08fd229e04ffb2c47f2d23d24b32e1d60c668", "ja": "ハイテンションで", "zh": "嗨起来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4100_p", "source_sha256": "cb5b4d9cdb97a8f629a1da441915bc82da1bba6686d6eb92e9f932872f0cc152", "ja": "昴はそのままでも、十分可愛いんだ。\nフリフリの衣装だって、問題なく着こなせるさ。", "zh": "昴平常的模样就很可爱了。\n就算穿充满荷叶边的服装，一定也没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4101_047sub", "source_sha256": "983d5e2e87f9b323a137885e02feae5b4a90f46605fefb3d8add48c1f14fe19c", "ja": "そのままでカワイイって……オ、オレが！？\nそ、そんなコト言われても、あんなフリフリ……。", "zh": "平常的模样就很可爱……我、我吗！？\n就、就算你这样说，那种荷叶边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4102_p", "source_sha256": "f199beec451573ee927ca3b49f046a5da08a15b07fbfa2080c4f98c517459d70", "ja": "大丈夫だ。俺を信じて、思いきって行け！\n失敗したら、ちゃんと責任は取るから。", "zh": "不要担心，相信我，尽全力表演吧！\n要是失败了，我一定会负起责任的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4103_047sub", "source_sha256": "5f0cdff3ef6ae9833b3fc552dd6f94e3521d132730f977214c38229e594e514c", "ja": "{$P$}……うう、わかったよ……。\n失敗したら、責任取ってくれよな！", "zh": "{$P$}……呜呜，我知道了啦……\n要是失败了，你会负起责任的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4104_047sub", "source_sha256": "ab8b94694fa7bce5f652484dcdccc965b45729e1eb6e459b155b161766e44e9f", "ja": "と、とりあえず……\nアイドルらしく、宣伝バシッと決めてみせるぞ！", "zh": "总、总之……\n我就表现出偶像风范，俐落地搞定宣传吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4200_p", "source_sha256": "9c709e5ead8e426f0c89dce42749f925c7caf536c4a7aba9e66a8076e9bcb8df", "ja": "昴だって、プロのアイドルなんだしな。\n衣装に合わせて可愛く振る舞えば、問題ないさ。", "zh": "毕竟昴也是专业的偶像啊。\n只要配合服装、摆出可爱的模样，就没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4201_047sub", "source_sha256": "0d1a02365c445238b3f6c48d1bde5b7c3405e49079bbb266d90d38d6522ca7f0", "ja": "それがカンタンにできないから言ってるんだろ～！\nうう……アイドルっぽくカワいくかぁ……。", "zh": "我就说没这么简单啊～！\n呜呜……像偶像一样可爱吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4202_047sub", "source_sha256": "c7638e2a4309dbeaf8b0027f1ed49fc1ea1d928d8e533f27c4bda60cc619a66c", "ja": "「みんな～！　今日は、来てくれてありがとー！\nオ……私、一生懸命頑張るぜ……わよ！」", "zh": "「各位～！今天谢谢你们来捧场～！\n我……人家会拚命努力啦……的哟！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4203_047sub", "source_sha256": "5b7d9b0af0e516888da44a1748a13ed088d8eb34847cae37f3344ddc07de698b", "ja": "うう、やっぱりヘンなカンジがする……。\nでも、やるしかないよな……！", "zh": "呜呜，感觉果然很奇怪……\n但只能先做再说了吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4300_p", "source_sha256": "cb6636fb8d7bd5a47e1a90b3c22f252e7c331ccd4fe8ff9128d3a52ff51df040", "ja": "勢いだ！　テンションを上げれば、何でもできる！\nハイテンションで乗り切れ！", "zh": "靠气势！只要情绪到了，什么都办得到！\n嗨起来克服难关吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4301_047sub", "source_sha256": "42848f42e91252fc72de4a9573586aaa69a1c8f4c3ad7716187bcb42493447e1", "ja": "ハ、ハイテンション？　って、言われても……\nえーと、何か参考になりそうなやつ……！", "zh": "嗨、嗨起来？就算你这么说……\n呃……有什么可以参考……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4302_047sub", "source_sha256": "3a8458777420f87cd59e5cb71aeda424d5d9bbb709e2a1fa8a23e400c6f0688f", "ja": "い……「イェイ！　昴だよ！　ビビッと\n宣伝頑張るから、よろしくね！　ファイト・オー☆」", "zh": "耶……「耶咿！我是昴唷！我会充满活力地\n好好宣传，请多指教啰！加油，噢～☆」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_4303_047sub", "source_sha256": "ac29e5e6bb89e4ba3af90def5a04709bc92987cbe75e468e3cd344f54d292a92", "ja": "いや、やっぱムリがあるだろ……！", "zh": "不，还是差太远了吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
